      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t3_bar_stool_shadow",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Drinking with the police. And discussing his own murders.",
          "words_spoken": 9,
          "est_dur_s": 3.13,
          "src_script": "1.03#7 · 2.09#8 · 2.09#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_bar_jury_room",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The Jury Room bar sat directly across from the Santa Cruz County Courthouse, a familiar haunt for detectives after shift.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 6.97,
          "src_script": "2.09#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_bar_stool_shadow",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Big Ed was a fixture in the corner. Standing six-foot-nine, wearing wire-rimmed glasses, remarkably courteous and articulate in law.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 6.62,
          "src_script": "1.03#6 · 2.07#12 · 2.09#2 · 2.09#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_galaxie",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "By day, he drove a yellow nineteen sixty-nine Ford Galaxie bearing a university employee parking decal on the front bumper.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 8.04,
          "src_script": "2.07#2 · 2.07#3 · 2.07#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_hitchhiker",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "That trusted campus decal, combined with his gentle academic facade, made female hitchhikers believe the vehicle was completely safe.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 7.64,
          "src_script": "2.07#5 · 2.07#10 · 2.07#12"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "t3_bar_jury_room",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "There were nights detectives drank draft beer with Ed, venting our frustrations over the elusive Co-ed Killer investigation.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 6.27,
          "src_script": "2.09#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "t3_bar_stool_shadow",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Ed would nod, sip his beer, analyze the evidence, and offer sharp theories about the killer’s psychological profile.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 6.27,
          "src_script": "2.09#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_bar_stool_shadow",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Looking back, ice chills our spine: The monster the entire city was hunting sat beside us, laughing about the very manhunt.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 7.32,
          "src_script": "2.09#8 · 2.09#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_brain_mirror",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The Halo Effect: superior intelligence and polite gentility formed an invisible camouflage blinding the entire law enforcement apparatus.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 7.04,
          "src_script": "2.07#10 · 5.06#3 · 5.06#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "t3_closing_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode three of Amber Eyes. Watch the full dossier via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.21,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
