          "after_id": "TK3.01#10",
          "text": "THEORETICAL PSYCHOLOGICAL FRAMEWORK",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t3_basement_stairs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Eight years old. Locked in a basement with a trapdoor under the table.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 4.51,
          "src_script": "3.05#6 · 3.05#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#2",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_coal_furnace",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Kemper’s mother, Clarnell, saw in her son the hated reflection of her ex-husband.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 5.09,
          "src_script": "3.05#4 · 3.05#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_small_bed",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "From age eight, Ed was banished to sleep in a damp basement beside the coal furnace, under a trapdoor beneath the upstairs dining table.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 9.39,
          "src_script": "3.05#6 · 3.05#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_trapdoor",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "To leave, the heavy table had to be lifted above. Confinement ended only when his father threatened police intervention.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 7.43,
          "src_script": "3.05#7 · 3.05#8"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_basement_stairs",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Every day, she subjected him to venomous verbal abuse, mocking his huge frame and crushing his self-esteem.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.65,
          "src_script": "3.05#9 · 3.05#12"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_mother_shadow",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "In the boy's psyche, the mother loomed as an omnipotent monument of cruelty: violently hated, yet too terrifying to confront.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 7.82,
          "src_script": "3.08#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_ucsc_campus",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Unable to retaliate directly against her, Kemper's brain activated the projection mechanism: seeking proxy victims.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.87,
          "src_script": "3.08#1 · 3.08#7 · 3.08#11"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_hitchhiker",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Young, graceful female students on the roadside embodied the freedom he craved, yet believed would reject him just as his mother had.",
          "words_spoken": 22,
          "est_dur_s": 8.61,
          "src_script": "3.08#10 · 3.08#11"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_apartos_house",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Innocent young women bore the horrifying brunt of the murderous fury intended for his own mother.",
          "words_spoken": 16,
          "est_dur_s": 5.56,
          "src_script": "3.08#11 · 3.08#13"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_brain_mirror",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "A clinical note: psychiatrists offered varied diagnostic labels over the years. This represents an explanatory framework, not a moral trial.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 6.95,
          "src_script": "3.04#1 · 3.08#3 · 3.11#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
